* A label on an align line in a vsect (C 3.2's c68 writes Agg: align before an initialized
* aggregate): defined after the alignment, in the vsect's initialized data, as r68 defines it
* (measured 2026-10-18: Ag at 2, Lc at 6). Before, r68togas left the label out: the reference to
* it became an external.
* expect sym: D Ag 00000002
* expect reloc: .data+0x00000006
* expect data: 0100 0000 0005 0006
 psect vs_al,0,0,0,0,0
 vsect
B1 dc.b 1
Ag: align
 dc.l 5
Lc align
 dc.w 6
 ends
 rts
 dc.l Ag,Lc
 ends
